  "releaseNotes": "v0.7.0 — Gold: Universal Socketing & Sovereign IoT HAL\n\n      New Features:\n      • Pulse Telemetry Engine — High-frequency, non-blocking telemetry stream (IPulseProvider)\n      • Hardware-Aware Manifest — HardwareTopology, RequiredInterface, SafetyBounds\n      • Reflex Guard — Governance-enforced hardware command validation\n      • Cross-Platform NativeInterface — WinUSB/libusb strategy selection\n\n      Architecture:\n      • Hardware commands are blocked unless signed; ungoverned commands require ForceExecute\n      • System.Text.Json used for SDK serialization\n      • Backward compatible with all v0.6.0 APIs\n\n      Quality:\n      • 10+ new unit tests covering pulse accuracy, reflex guard, and manifest serialization\n      • 0 compiler warnings in Release configuration",
